          "body": "\\[\n5x^2-20x+23=5(x^2-4x)+23\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=5\\big((x-2)^2-4\\big)+23\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=5(x-2)^2+3\n\\]"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": "\\(5(x-2)^2+3\\)."
