          "body": "Midpoint of \\(AC\\):\n\n\\[\n\\left(\\frac{16+24}{2},\\frac{-9+15}{2}\\right)=(20,3)\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Find the gradient",
          "body": "Gradient of \\(AC\\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac{15-(-9)}{24-16}=3\n\\]"
        },
