        {
          "title": "Factor each expression",
          "body": "Factor each expression:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{x(3x+1)(2x+1)}{(2x-1)(2x+1)}\\div\\frac{(5x-2)(3x+1)}{4(2x-1)}=2x\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\frac{x(3x+1)}{2x-1}\\times\\frac{4(2x-1)}{(5x-2)(3x+1)}=2x\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\frac{4x}{5x-2}=2x\n\\]\n\n\\[\n4x=2x(5x-2)\n\\]\n\n\\[\n10x^2-8x=0\n\\]\n\n\\[\n2x(5x-4)=0\n\\]"
        },
